  "description": "SAJGIY crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C89 H86 Cl2 Er6 N24 O28,10(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 5 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 5 O neighbors; Er5 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er6 (Er) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.842-4.892 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 111.69-172.33°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C99H126Cl2Er6N24O38.",
